observed-jemalloc
Copyright 2024 Scott Gerring.

A drop-in libjemalloc.so with OTel heap-profiling USDTs.

This product bundles jemalloc, which is available under a BSD-2-Clause license.
See: https://github.com/jemalloc/jemalloc/blob/dev/COPYING

USDT probe emission uses the SystemTap SDT header (<sys/sdt.h>), which is
available under the GPL-2.0-or-later license with a special exception for
inclusion in non-GPL programs.
